#: mvc/app/views/OPNsense/PolicyAnalyzer/quarantine_setup.volt:145
msgid ""
"When an external address enters the quarantine. Fixed by design: the base "
"trigger (1 or more blocked inbound connections in the 5-minute window) and "
"the ladder of durations; the rest is adjustable."
