#: mvc/app/views/OPNsense/PolicyAnalyzer/setup.volt:154
msgid ""
"Where should the explanations come from? Ollama keeps the data in your "
"network; Claude Code (LAN) sends it to a computer in your network that "
"passes it on to Anthropic with its Claude Code subscription; an API sends "
"anonymized findings to the provider."
